risk: medium
confidence: high
expected_result: Supported runtimes retain parseable machine channels and strict unexpected-stderr detection
actual_result: Node 24.12.0 emits native SQLite ExperimentalWarning into two strict subprocess assertions; no exact coverage artifact is produced
